{"id":"dazu","lemma":"dazu","pos":"adv","rank":226,"glosses":["in addition to it, in addition, besides","for that purpose","to it, to that"],"ipa":"/daˈtsuː/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f7/De-dazu.ogg/De-dazu.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Was meinst du dazu?","en":"What do you think about it?","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to opine, to think","l":"meinen"},{"g":"you"},null]},{"text":"Hast du das Zeug dazu?","en":"Do you have what it takes?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/761639","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"stuff, gear, equipment"},null]},{"text":"Wie ist es dazu gekommen?","en":"How did it come to this?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"to come","l":"kommen"}]},{"text":"Ich hatte keine Zeit dazu.","en":"I didn't have time for that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/718044","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"time"},null]},{"text":"Das gehört zur Arbeit dazu.","en":"It's part of the job.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"toil"},null]}]}